From 922476eda5276af1eb1f151bbffed1c5aeaee0ad Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Eric Wu <eric3u@outlook.com>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 23:13:37 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 7/9] NetworkPkg: Add Simplified Chinese strings

Translate the configuration forms of HTTP boot, iSCSI, IPv4, IPv6, TLS
and VLAN into Simplified Chinese (zh-Hans). The x-UEFI-ns keywords of
iSCSI are left alone.

As in MdeModulePkg, every string gets a zh-Hans entry, protocol names
and empty strings included, and hanzi carry \wide and \narrow markers.

Signed-off-by: Eric Wu <eric3u@outlook.com>
---
 .../HttpBootDxe/HttpBootConfigStrings.uni     | 13 ++++
 NetworkPkg/IScsiDxe/IScsiConfigStrings.uni    | 69 +++++++++++++++++++
 NetworkPkg/Ip4Dxe/Ip4DxeStrings.uni           | 18 +++++
 NetworkPkg/Ip6Dxe/Ip6DxeStrings.uni           | 45 ++++++++++++
 .../TlsAuthConfigDxeStrings.uni               | 19 +++++
 .../VlanConfigDxe/VlanConfigStrings.uni       | 19 +++++
 6 files changed, 183 insertions(+)

